<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay's October tax collection up 15.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Paraguay's October tax collection up 15.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay's tax collection rose 15.4 percent in October against the same month a year ago, the Central Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank did not provide figures for tax collection, just percentage variations.</p>
<p>-- Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion Newsroom, 595 21 444527</p>
